# Launchers must keep their native line endings or they break in confusing ways:
#   * .bat is read by cmd.exe, which tolerates CRLF (and mis-renders bare LF in
#     some Windows builds) — so force CRLF.
#   * .command / .sh is read by bash; a CRLF shebang fails with
#     "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", so force LF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
